			<h2>Simple Analytics</h2>		<p>Empower your choices with insights derived from our real-time data streams.</p>					\n			<img \n					data-interaction-id=\"6df8d40\" \n		 data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"6df8d40\"\n									id=\"36\"\n												src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Card_mask-group.png\"\n												width=\"725\"\n												height=\"308\"\n												srcset=\"\"\n												alt=\"\"\n						/>\n						<h2>Generate <br>\nReports with Ease</h2>		<p>Easily download reports comprising of data from your sales reps or a custom date range.</p>					\n			<img \n					data-interaction-id=\"48507e0\" \n		 data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"48507e0\"\n									id=\"37\"\n												src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Card_mask-group-1.png\"\n												width=\"696\"\n												height=\"452\"\n												srcset=\"\"\n												alt=\"\"\n						/>\n						<h2>Transparent <br>\nSales Tracking</h2>		<p>Keep an eye on sales by tracking the revenue generated by every team member.</p>					\n			<img \n					data-interaction-id=\"364b0fc\" \n		 data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"364b0fc\"\n									id=\"38\"\n												src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Card_mask-group-2-1.png\"\n												width=\"696\"\n												height=\"508\"\n												srcset=\"\"\n												alt=\"\"\n						/>\n						<h2>Invite Unlimited Team  Members</h2>		<p>Don\'t leave the team behind and easily invite unlimited team members onboard.</p>					\n			<img \n					data-interaction-id=\"3f5c4e0\" \n		 data-e-type=\"widget\" data-id=\"3f5c4e0\"\n									id=\"35\"\n												src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Card.png\"\n												width=\"818\"\n												height=\"820\"\n												srcset=\"\"\n												alt=\"\"\n						/>\n						<h2>Customer Stories</h2>					<p>Voices of Success and Satisfaction</p>							\n			<meta itemprop=\"worstRating\" content=\"0\">\n			<meta itemprop=\"bestRating\" content=\"5\">\n									<p>&#8220;This Platform Transformed How We Work&#8211;Faster Teams, Better Collaboration, and Real Results in Just Weeks. Couldn&#8217;t Imagine Managing Projects Without It Anymore.&#8221;</p>								\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Close-up-Portrait-with-Black-Turtleneck.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />															\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-711.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />															\n					<h2>James West</h2>				\n									<p>Creative Director</p>								\n			<meta itemprop=\"worstRating\" content=\"0\">\n			<meta itemprop=\"bestRating\" content=\"5\">\n									<p>&#8220;This Platform Transformed How We Work&#8211;Faster Teams, Better Collaboration, and Real Results in Just Weeks. Couldn&#8217;t Imagine Managing Projects Without It Anymore.&#8221;</p>								\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Close-up-Portrait-with-Black-Turtleneck.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />															\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-711.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />															\n					<h2>James West</h2>				\n									<p>Creative Director</p>								\n			<meta itemprop=\"worstRating\" content=\"0\">\n			<meta itemprop=\"bestRating\" content=\"5\">\n									<p>&#8220;This Platform Transformed How We Work&#8211;Faster Teams, Better Collaboration, and Real Results in Just Weeks. Couldn&#8217;t Imagine Managing Projects Without It Anymore.&#8221;</p>								\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Close-up-Portrait-with-Black-Turtleneck.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />															\n															<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://s