s Important Deadlines Anymore.\"</p>													<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Cheerful-Man-in-Blazer-5.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-4-11.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<h2>Michael Reed</h2>		<p>Project Lead</p>					\n			<meta itemprop=\"worstRating\" content=\"0\">\n			<meta itemprop=\"bestRating\" content=\"5\">\n				<p>\"From Day One, the Experience was Smooth and Professional. Our Team Loves Using It Daily. Its Rare to Find Software like that. It\'s become an essential part of our team\'s success.\" </p>													<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Cheerful-Curly-Haired-Man-in-Tortoiseshell-Glasses.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"48\" height=\"48\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-711.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<h2>Daniel Carter</h2>		<p>Project Lead</p>			<h2>Used by global powerhouses like</h2>															<img width=\"100\" height=\"25\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-6.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"180\" height=\"21\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-5.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"155\" height=\"21\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-2.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"133\" height=\"27\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-4.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"110\" height=\"29\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-3.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"133\" height=\"27\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-4.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<p>Spot Issues faster via SmartIntegrations!</p>		<p>Effortlessly connect with your favourite tools. Weather it\'s your CRM, email marketing platform, or project management tool, we\'ve got you covered.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Book your demo\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"800\" height=\"564\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-1000012636.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"800\" height=\"564\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-1000012636-1.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<p>Data available instantly, always will be Updated!</p>		<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Stay ahead of the game with Instant Data Access. Our platform ensures that you always have the latest updates on sales, analytics, and customer behavior at your fingertips.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Book your demo\n					</a>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','13-revision-v1','','','2026-08-14 09:47:21','2026-08-14 09:47:21','',13,'http://secondwebsite.local/?p=223',0,'revision','',0);
