rc=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-2.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"133\" height=\"27\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-4.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"110\" height=\"29\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-3.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"133\" height=\"27\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Component-4.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<p>Spot Issues faster via SmartIntegrations!</p>		<p>Effortlessly connect with your favourite tools. Weather it\'s your CRM, email marketing platform, or project management tool, we\'ve got you covered.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Book your demo\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"800\" height=\"564\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-1000012636.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																										<img width=\"800\" height=\"564\" src=\"http://secondwebsite.local/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Frame-1000012636-1.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />																<p>Data available instantly, always will be Updated!</p>		<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Stay ahead of the game with Instant Data Access. Our platform ensures that you always have the latest updates on sales, analytics, and customer behavior at your fingertips.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Book your demo\n					</a>\n									<h2>Pricing Plan</h2>					<p>Transparent pricing.</p>		<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Simple plans, upfront costs,  &amp; zero surprices-pricing made easy &amp; completely transparent.</p>			<h2>Starter Plan</h2>					<h2>Free</h2>		<p>Perfect to nget started with Appentic.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									Get Started - Free\n					</a>\n									<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"